    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scenario 4 — Lead Enrichment Pipeline\n\nWebhook → Fetch Leads (simulated) → Loop → Enrich from API → AI Score → Build Record → Save to CRM → Respond\n\n**Pattern:** Batch Processing + API Enrichment + AI Scoring + CRM Update\n\n**Key concepts:**\n- Split in Batches (1) for per-lead processing\n- HTTP Request enriches with external data (simulated)\n- AI Agent scores lead fit for the company's ICP\n- Edit Fields builds clean CRM record with fallbacks\n- Loop back to Process Leads, done output → Respond\n\n⚠️ Wire: OpenAI → ai_languageModel, Output Parser → ai_outputParser on Score Lead",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 500
      },
